# PEPL Next.js Project Rules

## Content / Copy
- All copy and text **must** live in `lib/content.ts`. Never hardcode strings in page or component files.

## Styling
- Colors are defined as CSS variables in `app/globals.css`: `--bg`, `--ink`, `--acc`, `--hl`.
- Do **not** hardcode new color values anywhere; always reference the CSS variables.
- Border-radius is `0` everywhere.
- Dividers are `2px` solid.
- Headings are `uppercase`, font family is `Archivo`.

## Architecture
- Pages must remain **Server Components**. Do **not** add `'use client'` to page files.
- Do **not** remove or modify `metadata` exports — they are required for SEO.

## Build Validation
- After every set of changes, run `npm run build` and fix any errors before finishing.
